graph TD
    A[Stock Level] --> B[Detect Low Stock]
    B -->|Normal| DONE1[No Action]
    B -->|Low| C[Calculate Reorder Quantity]
    C -->|Error| D1[Use Default Quantity]
    C -->|Success| E[Check Vendor Availability]
    D1 --> E
    E -->|Unavailable| F1[Flag for Manual Review]
    E -->|Available| F[Create Purchase Suggestion]
    F -->|Error| G1[Queue for Retry]
    F -->|Success| G[Notify Inventory Manager]
    G -->|Error| W1[Log Warning]
    G -->|Success| DONE2[Suggestion Created]

    style DONE1 fill:#9f9
    style F1 fill:#ff9
    style G1 fill:#ff9
    style W1 fill:#ff9
    style DONE2 fill:#9f9
